{"id":"53fcdabad44b89e5","group":"58","path":"58/batch20/58-df-dirichlet.md","title":"Dirichlet","display":"df-dirichlet — Dirichlet","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-dirichlet","aliases":["58-df-dirichlet"],"display":"df-dirichlet — Dirichlet","depends_on":["[[58-df-dirichlet-character]]","[[58-df-character]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-dirichlet"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-dirichlet</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-dirichlet — Dirichlet"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"7101d8e1cbc25a43\" href=\"?note=7101d8e1cbc25a43\" title=\"58-df-dirichlet-character\">58-df-dirichlet-character</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9fa1a80aa97659ab\" href=\"?note=9fa1a80aa97659ab\" title=\"58-df-character\">58-df-character</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\">\\(q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\)</span> (Dirichlet character, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"7101d8e1cbc25a43\" href=\"?note=7101d8e1cbc25a43\" title=\"58-df-dirichlet-character\">58-df-dirichlet-character</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s,\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\">\\(s,\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\">\\(\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\)</span> (argument and candidate series value)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DirichletLValue}_S(\\ell,s,\\chi,q)\">\\(\\mathrm{DirichletLValue}_S(\\ell,s,\\chi,q)\\)</span> (Dirichlet-series value relation defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletLValue}_S(\\ell,s,\\chi,q)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land s,\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\\land\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\land\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\land\\ell=\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\frac{\\chi(n)}{n^s}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletLValue}_S(\\ell,s,\\chi,q)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land s,\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\\land\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\land\\operatorname{Re}(s)&gt;1\\land\\ell=\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\frac{\\chi(n)}{n^s}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The series value is an explicit argument of the relation; no undeclared global symbol <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L(s,\\chi)\">\\(L(s,\\chi)\\)</span> is assumed.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-dirichlet-character","status":"resolved","id":"7101d8e1cbc25a43","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-dirichlet-character]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-character","status":"resolved","id":"9fa1a80aa97659ab","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-character]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-dirichlet-character","status":"resolved","id":"7101d8e1cbc25a43","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}$ and $\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)$ (Dirichlet character, see [[58-df-dirichlet-character]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)","display":false},{"tex":"s,\\ell\\in\\mathbb C","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Re}(s)>1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DirichletLValue}_S(\\ell,s,\\chi,q)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}dirichlet} \\vdash \\mathrm{DirichletLValue}_S(\\ell,s,\\chi,q)\\leftrightarrow q\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\land s,\\ell\\in\\mathbb C\\land\\mathrm{DirichletChar}_S(\\chi,q)\\land\\operatorname{Re}(s)>1\\land\\ell=\\lim_{N\\to\\infty}\\sum_{n=1}^{N}\\frac{\\chi(n)}{n^s}","display":true},{"tex":"L(s,\\chi)","display":false}],"bytes":1002,"backlinks":[{"id":"9fa1a80aa97659ab","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"The associated $L$-series is not introduced as a free global symbol here; [[58-df-dirichlet]] defines its value relation from the coefficients $\\chi(n)$."},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-442","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-dirichlet.md|58-df-dirichlet]]（batch20）"}],"outgoing":["7101d8e1cbc25a43","9fa1a80aa97659ab"]}